    <string name="location_auto">Automatic location</string>
    <string name="location_auto_sub">Off by default. When on, a background task may read one fix if always-allow is granted. This does not add a geofence or listen all day.</string>
    <string name="location_note">Mika uses the Android location service, not a separate map vendor. A place name appears only when the system geocoder returns one. Coordinates are not written to the run log. Granting location does not let Mika send your position to another service. Battery limits can block a background reading. Not verified on a Samsung device.</string>
